---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CTABlock from '../../components/CTABlock.astro';
import { site } from '../../config/site';

const inviteEmail = site.email;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Account Setup Checklist — Domain, Cloudflare & GitHub | Groundwork Dental"
  description="One-time checklist: confirm your domain registrar, then set up Cloudflare and GitHub via Zoom or DIY invite."
  noindex={false}
>
  <section class="bg-surface-2">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 md:py-16">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="eyebrow text-sage-dark mb-4">Client checklist</p>
        <h1 class="section-heading mb-6">Account setup checklist</h1>
        <p class="font-serif text-xl text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">
          You own the accounts. We build in them. You can remove our access anytime. One-time setup — about 15 minutes.
        </p>
        <p class="font-sans text-sm text-mid-gray mt-6">
          <a href="/guides/account-setup.md" class="text-sage-dark hover:underline">Markdown version</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-10">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">

      <div id="domain" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-3">1. Domain registrar</h2>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg text-mid-gray leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Where you renew <code class="text-base">yourpractice.com</code> (GoDaddy, Google/Squarespace Domains, Namecheap, etc.) — separate from whoever built the site.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Log in and confirm you control the domain</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Reply with: registrar name + can you log in? (Yes / No / Not sure)</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Don’t</strong> change nameservers or DNS (especially mail/MX) until we say so</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Can’t find or log in? <a href={`mailto:${inviteEmail}`} class="text-sage-dark hover:underline">Email us</a> — we’ll help.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-3">2. Cloudflare &amp; GitHub</h2>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg text-mid-gray leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Pick one. Same result: accounts in your name, Groundwork as admin.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
          <a href="#option-1" class="block border border-neutral-200 bg-surface-2 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-sage-dark transition-colors">
            <p class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-sage-dark mb-2">Option 1</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-2">Zoom</h3>
            <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">We drive. You verify email and set passwords.</p>
          </a>
          <a href="#option-2" class="block border border-neutral-200 bg-surface-2 rounded-lg p-5 hover:border-sage-dark transition-colors">
            <p class="font-sans text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-sage-dark mb-2">Option 2</p>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-2">DIY</h3>
            <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">You create accounts and invite us as admin.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="option-1" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-4">Option 1 — Zoom</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Reply asking for a Zoom setup</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Join with practice email open + registrar login available</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Verify Cloudflare/GitHub emails, set passwords, save them</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          We handle invites, site connection, and domain cutover at go-live.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="option-2" class="scroll-mt-24">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-6">Option 2 — DIY</h2>

        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">Cloudflare</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-charcoal mb-8">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Sign up at <a href="https://dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sage-dark hover:underline">dash.cloudflare.com/sign-up</a> with practice email (Free plan)</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><strong>Manage Account</strong> → <strong>Members</strong> → invite <code class="text-base">{inviteEmail}</code> as <strong>Administrator</strong></span></li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">GitHub</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-charcoal mb-8">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Sign up at <a href="https://github.com/signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-sage-dark hover:underline">github.com/signup</a> (same email if possible)</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>When we send the repo link: invite <code class="text-base">@gwgunther</code> (Groundwork) as <strong>Write</strong> or <strong>Admin</strong></span></li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal mb-3">Wrap up</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-3 font-serif text-lg text-charcoal">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Reply when invites are sent</span></li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="mt-1 shrink-0 w-5 h-5 border border-charcoal/40 rounded-sm" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Leave DNS / nameservers alone</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-4">At go-live — we handle</h2>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">
          Copy DNS (esp. email) → point nameservers at the registrar → connect the real domain → confirm site + email → handoff doc.
        </p>
        <p class="font-serif text-mid-gray mt-4 leading-relaxed">
          Optional later: move the domain into Cloudflare. Not required for launch. Ongoing cost: ~$12–15/year domain renewal. Hosting free.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-charcoal mb-3">Questions</h2>
        <p class="font-serif text-lg text-mid-gray leading-relaxed">
          <a href={`mailto:${inviteEmail}`} class="text-sage-dark hover:underline">{inviteEmail}</a>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <CTABlock
    heading="Ready when you are"
    subheading="Domain first, then Option 1 or 2. About 15 minutes, one time."
    primaryCTA="Get Started"
    primaryHref="/get-started"
    secondaryCTA="How It Works"
    secondaryHref="/how-it-works"
  />
</BaseLayout>
